      "result": "Per-surah ayah counts in QuranAtlas's KFGQPC dataset agree with quran-meta (Tanzil-derived) for all 114 surahs and all three riwayat. Hafs total 6236, Warsh / Qaloon total 6214. The divergence set listed below is corroborated by an independent dataset.",
      "method": "Parsed quran-meta SurahList tuples [startAyahId, ayahCount, surahOrder, rukuCount, name, used], extracted ayahCount per surah, compared against surahs.json[].counts."
    },
    "verifiedScholarly": false
